BRIEFING-CURRENT-STATE.md accreted-narrative history log
===========================================================

Purpose: BRIEFING-CURRENT-STATE.md is titled "Where We Are Right Now" — it should state current
sprint/epic position, not carry the full month-by-month progression that got it there. This log
is where that history moves per the context-floor-reduction plan (2026-09-21, PM-directed), item 1
(Docs-owned). Extracted content is verbatim from the source file at the point of extraction.

Format: dated entries, append-only, like decisions.log. Not read routinely by agents — consulted
only when someone needs the historical progression behind the current STATUS BANNER.

**Scope note (honest, not a completion claim)**: this file's STATUS BANNER section contains a much
larger body of accreted "UPDATE [date range] (Role attest)" entries beyond what's extracted below
— the two blocks below were the ones the source document's own authors had already explicitly
labeled "superseded... retained for record," making them a safe, unambiguous extraction. The rest
of the UPDATE chain is live multi-role editorial content (Lead Dev, PPM, CIO, Docs all attest
different lanes into the same banner) that requires judgment about what's still operationally
current versus safely prunable — judgment Docs is not positioned to make unilaterally for other
roles' own attestations. Flagged to Exec/PM as a separate, larger finding rather than cut here.

